            <ArticleTitle>Biosoluble polymeric medicinal films.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>9-13</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This paper offers a brief review of the issues related to selection of the polymeric matrix base that determines the possibilities of forming medicinal film. Estimated is its efficiency as compared to other polymeric carriers. Also discussed are examples of using medicinal films in certain fields of medicine.</AbstractText>
